# Code Owners
#
# Each module and top-level area has a designated owner who is responsible for:
# - reviewing changes to the module's public API
# - maintaining the module's CHANGELOG entry
# - answering questions about design decisions
#
# Format: each line is `path glob    owner`
# More specific paths take precedence.

# ---- Core library ----
src/core/                    @nimrtc/maintainers

# ---- Modules ----
src/modules/rtp/             @nimrtc/agent-rtpcodec
src/modules/sdp/             @nimrtc/agent-sdp
src/modules/jb/              @nimrtc/agent-jitterbuffer

# ---- Build & CI ----
CMakeLists.txt               @nimrtc/maintainers
cmake/                       @nimrtc/maintainers
.github/                     @nimrtc/maintainers
CMakePresets.json            @nimrtc/maintainers

# ---- Documentation ----
docs/                        @nimrtc/maintainers
docs/zh/                     @nimrtc/maintainers

# ---- Root project files ----
*                            @nimrtc/maintainers
